{"id":"607657","name":"三色糙米炒饭","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/607657/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"三色糙米","amount":"1杯"},{"name":"清水","amount":"1.5杯"}],"sub":[{"name":"基围虾","amount":"8个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"三色糙米淘洗，浸泡2小时后煮熟，米和水的比例1：1.5左右。","img":"images/607657/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"新鲜虾剥皮，去虾线，去头，剥成虾仁。","img":"images/607657/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青瓜切成丁。","img":"images/607657/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放油，放入虾仁炒熟。","img":"images/607657/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入米饭继续炒。","img":"images/607657/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入黄瓜丁继续炒，再放少量盐和生抽，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/607657/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"关火。","img":"images/607657/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"开吃，健康美味！","img":"images/607657/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}